{
  "name": "Fear Aura",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Any creature hostile to Eidolon that starts its turn within 20 feet of it or enters that area for the first time on a turn, must make a Wisdom Saving Throw against your spell save DC, unless the Eidolon is Incapacitated. On a failed save, the creature is Frightened until the start of its next turn. If a creature's Saving Throw is successful, the creature is Immune to the Eidolon's Fear Aura for the next 24 hours.</p>",
